{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_coperto_e_menu_fisso_cover_charge", "label": "Coperto (cover charge, migrations v88-v90)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/coperto-e-menu-fisso.md", "source_location": "L42", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "(covers - covers included in a menu) x amount; takeaway pays no cover; covers are correctable on an open order via PATCH /orders/:id/guests, and the cover travels with the total in recomputeOrderAfterItemChange() so the printed line never divides an old amount by new heads."}, {"id": "docs_coperto_e_menu_fisso_order_cover_charge", "label": "orderCoverCharge() / computeCoverCharge", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/coperto-e-menu-fisso.md", "source_location": "L186", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Included covers count one per menu and never more than the guests (computeCoverCharge clamps at zero); recomputed in orderCoverCharge() from every point that changes rows: create, append, recompute, cancel, restore."}, {"id": "docs_coperto_e_menu_fisso_order_charges", "label": "orderCharges() single charge sum (main/money.ts)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/coperto-e-menu-fisso.md", "source_location": "L63", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Delivery, packaging and cover were six hand-written formulas; the cover would have been the seventh chance to forget one."}, {"id": "docs_coperto_e_menu_fisso_insert_order_item_rows", "label": "insertOrderItemRows() unified row writer", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/coperto-e-menu-fisso.md", "source_location": "L207", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The row-writing loop was copied in order creation and item append; unified before the menu expansion became one more thing to keep aligned by hand (likewise cartItemToPayload in the UI)."}, {"id": "docs_coperto_e_menu_fisso_is_pending_kot", "label": "isPendingKot (lib/kot.ts)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/coperto-e-menu-fisso.md", "source_location": "L303", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The three UI counts of what is still to send (map, panel, table card) excluded different things; all now pass through one predicate, which also leaves void_adjustment rows out."}, {"id": "docs_coperto_e_menu_fisso", "label": "Coperto e menu fisso", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/coperto-e-menu-fisso.md", "source_location": "L1", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_coperto_e_menu_fisso_menu_quantity_patch", "label": "PATCH /orders/:id/menu-groups/:groupId { quantity }", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/coperto-e-menu-fisso.md", "source_location": "L456", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Changes how many menus a line holds, for the friend who arrives late; below the dishes already in a course it answers 409 menu_course_overflow naming the course; same roles and checks as the fill and in the handheld allowlist; removing the menu row removes all N menus."}, {"id": "docs_coperto_e_menu_fisso_attach_to_menu_modal", "label": "AttachToMenuModal and ServiceRunPicker", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/coperto-e-menu-fisso.md", "source_location": "L367", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Born with the menu window's contract (props in, callback out, no API client), so the redone handheld mounted them as they are."}, {"id": "docs_coperto_e_menu_fisso_cancel_target_ids", "label": "cancelTargetIds split cancel (package vs dish)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/coperto-e-menu-fisso.md", "source_location": "L258", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The package row is the menu and cancelling it removes everything; a dish row is only itself, so changing one's mind on the main does not lose the starter already eaten; restore follows the same rule."}, {"id": "docs_coperto_e_menu_fisso_compact_rows", "label": "compactKotItems / compactBillRows / compactOrderRows", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/coperto-e-menu-fisso.md", "source_location": "L386", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "'Lasagne 3' is only how identical portions are shown: compactKotItems on the ticket, compactBillRows on the preconto and compactOrderRows on the table screens; since 2026-09-24 they also sum a la carte dishes added in several rounds."}, {"id": "docs_coperto_e_menu_fisso_course_exceptions", "label": "fixed_menu_course_products per-dish exceptions (v93)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/coperto-e-menu-fisso.md", "source_location": "L266", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Exceptions both ways (a dish in the category but not in the menu, or outside it and in); explicit beats category. A separate table because SQLite cannot add a column with CHECK and the editor prunes surcharges."}, {"id": "docs_coperto_e_menu_fisso_covers_for_new_order", "label": "coversForNewOrder (covers start from table)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/coperto-e-menu-fisso.md", "source_location": "L87", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A new order's covers start from the booking's party if the table is booked, otherwise from the table's seats, within 1-99. A hand-set count (guestCountChosen) sticks across table changes; an open order keeps its own covers, and appending dishes no longer shows the counter."}, {"id": "docs_coperto_e_menu_fisso_fixed_menu", "label": "Menu fisso (fixed menu as a product)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/coperto-e-menu-fisso.md", "source_location": "L122", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A fixed menu is a product with a flag, inheriting order rows, bill, archive and reports for free; courses, course categories and surcharges hang around it."}, {"id": "docs_coperto_e_menu_fisso_fixed_menu_picker", "label": "FixedMenuPicker window (counted menu)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/coperto-e-menu-fisso.md", "source_location": "L402", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Takes catalogue and menu as props and returns the selection with a callback on the AddonModal model, with no API client, which makes it mountable in the handheld Server App. Every number on it counts dishes: a course shows '3 di 8' in amber while short and red when over, and a full course greys out its other dishes and flashes 'Al completo'."}, {"id": "docs_coperto_e_menu_fisso_menu_a_conteggio", "label": "Menu a conteggio (counted fixed menu)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/coperto-e-menu-fisso.md", "source_location": "L371", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "At the table one asks how many take the menu and then counts dishes course by course; one group with the menu row at quantity N, dishes still one row per portion, shown compacted. Chosen over quantity rows to avoid splitting rows when one portion changes run or gets a note."}, {"id": "docs_coperto_e_menu_fisso_menu_course_id", "label": "order_items.menu_course_id (v95)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/coperto-e-menu-fisso.md", "source_location": "L245", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Says which course a row satisfies; deducing it from the category stopped working once a course takes a dish from outside its categories or two courses share one; backfilled only where exactly one course matches."}, {"id": "docs_coperto_e_menu_fisso_menu_group_id", "label": "order_items.menu_group_id and menu_role", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/coperto-e-menu-fisso.md", "source_location": "L137", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "menu_role (package or course) lets each row say what it is without a join to products, the same reason product_name is copied on the row; two menus at one table are two groups."}, {"id": "docs_coperto_e_menu_fisso_not_a_menu_package", "label": "NOT_A_MENU_PACKAGE KDS filter (services/kds.ts)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/coperto-e-menu-fisso.md", "source_location": "L199", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The KDS reads the same rows as the ticket, so the package would have appeared as a dish to cook; the ticket filter sits in routeItemsToStations so the package row still receives its kot_batch stamp."}, {"id": "docs_coperto_e_menu_fisso_open_menu", "label": "Menu aperto: a container that fills (v95)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/coperto-e-menu-fisso.md", "source_location": "L240", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A required course may stay empty since the price sits on the package. The rejected alternative was declaring only how many menus and guessing the attribution, which would change what the guest pays whenever it guesses wrong."}, {"id": "docs_coperto_e_menu_fisso_plan_course_fill", "label": "planCourseFill matching", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/coperto-e-menu-fisso.md", "source_location": "L469", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A bare id keeps the row's note and run, so a 'no salt' soup is not cancelled and rewritten; the most precise requests match first (note and run, then note, then bare ids), and rows already in the kitchen before pending ones, so removing one lasagna of three frees a pending one instead of a 409."}, {"id": "docs_coperto_e_menu_fisso_real_rows_rule", "label": "Fixed menu writes real order rows", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/coperto-e-menu-fisso.md", "source_location": "L26", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "An addon group item has no category, and the kitchen ticket sections by product category, so a package built on addons reached the kitchen undivided. The menu writes one real row per chosen dish; the price stays on the package row."}, {"id": "docs_coperto_e_menu_fisso_service_run", "label": "Uscite: order_items.service_run 1..9 (v94)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/coperto-e-menu-fisso.md", "source_location": "L278", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "When a dish leaves the kitchen, not when it was sent; the default comes from categories.default_service_run and the ticket sections by run, then by category. Runs are labels, not gates, because 'send only the first run' would be a second state to keep aligned with kot_batch; inside a menu a dish takes its category's run and is not moved by hand."}, {"id": "docs_coperto_e_menu_fisso_discount_follows_count", "label": "Line discount follows the menu count", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/coperto-e-menu-fisso.md", "source_location": "L462", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A discount agreed on the menu line scales with the number (five menus out of eight keep five eighths), since keeping it whole would leave eight menus' discount on the one left while the floor changes the count and a discount needs the manager PIN; an order discount in euros stops at what remains on the check."}, {"id": "docs_coperto_e_menu_fisso_portion_note", "label": "Per-portion note icon in the dish row", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/coperto-e-menu-fisso.md", "source_location": "L429", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The note for a single portion is the icon left of the minus, shown once the dish has at least one portion: it takes one portion from the plain count and gives it its own row under the dish with the note; the cross removes the note and returns it to the count without changing the dish total. The field is 16 px on the phone because the iPhone zooms the page on smaller fields."}, {"id": "docs_coperto_e_menu_fisso_printable_bill_rows", "label": "printableBillRows (cancelled rows off the preconto)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/coperto-e-menu-fisso.md", "source_location": "L479", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A lasagna removed before reaching the kitchen printed at 10,00 above a total that did not count it; now cancelled rows stay off the bill while voided ones stay beside their negative compensating line, with one rule per printing path (main/printers/thermal.ts, and frontend/src/lib/printer/bill-rows.ts shared by the browser encoder and HTML page)."}, {"id": "docs_coperto_e_menu_fisso_is_required_prevista", "label": "is_required becomes \u00abPrevista\u00bb (expected course)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/coperto-e-menu-fisso.md", "source_location": "L345", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Since a menu can be rung up half-decided, is_required no longer blocks the order: it says which courses the menu expects, i.e. what to flag if the check closes without them; a missing course is an amber row and never a refusal."}, {"id": "docs_coperto_e_menu_fisso_menu_count_field", "label": "\u00abQuanti menu?\u00bb count with no default", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/coperto-e-menu-fisso.md", "source_location": "L404", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "One stepper whose number can also be typed; it starts from no number and nothing is added without it, because with mixed tables starting from the covers would charge menus not taken. The bottom button says 'Quanti menu?' and points the finger there, and the field selects its content a frame after the tap because the iPhone ignores a selection made while the cursor arrives ('8' plus '20' became 82 menus)."}, {"id": "docs_coperto_e_menu_fisso_stable_rows", "label": "Nothing moves under the finger (fixed-width dish row controls)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/coperto-e-menu-fisso.md", "source_location": "L421", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A table of twenty is counted in sixty quick taps without looking, and every growing row shifted the others so a tap landed on the next dish or on the note button (it happened on 2026-10-07). Now note, minus, number and plus keep fixed widths with the not-yet-needed ones invisible, the name changes colour rather than weight, and the footer has a fixed-height status line."}], "edges": [{"source": "docs_coperto_e_menu_fisso_attach_to_menu_modal", "target": "docs_coperto_e_menu_fisso_fixed_menu_picker", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/coperto-e-menu-fisso.md", "source_location": "L367", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_coperto_e_menu_fisso_course_exceptions", "target": "docs_coperto_e_menu_fisso_fixed_menu", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/coperto-e-menu-fisso.md", "source_location": "L268", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_coperto_e_menu_fisso_covers_for_new_order", "target": "docs_coperto_e_menu_fisso_cover_charge", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/coperto-e-menu-fisso.md", "source_location": "L87", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_coperto_e_menu_fisso_printable_bill_rows", "target": "docs_coperto_e_menu_fisso_compact_rows", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/coperto-e-menu-fisso.md", "source_location": "L387", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_coperto_e_menu_fisso_fixed_menu", "target": "docs_coperto_e_menu_fisso_menu_group_id", "relation": "implements", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/coperto-e-menu-fisso.md", "source_location": "L137", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_coperto_e_menu_fisso_insert_order_item_rows", "target": "docs_coperto_e_menu_fisso_fixed_menu", "relation": "implements", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/coperto-e-menu-fisso.md", "source_location": "L207", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_coperto_e_menu_fisso_menu_a_conteggio", "target": "docs_coperto_e_menu_fisso_fixed_menu_picker", "relation": "implements", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/coperto-e-menu-fisso.md", "source_location": "L402", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_coperto_e_menu_fisso_menu_a_conteggio", "target": "docs_coperto_e_menu_fisso_menu_quantity_patch", "relation": "implements", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/coperto-e-menu-fisso.md", "source_location": "L456", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_coperto_e_menu_fisso_not_a_menu_package", "target": "docs_coperto_e_menu_fisso_real_rows_rule", "relation": "implements", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/coperto-e-menu-fisso.md", "source_location": "L199", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_coperto_e_menu_fisso_open_menu", "target": "docs_coperto_e_menu_fisso_menu_course_id", "relation": "implements", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/coperto-e-menu-fisso.md", "source_location": "L245", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_coperto_e_menu_fisso_open_menu", "target": "docs_coperto_e_menu_fisso_cancel_target_ids", "relation": "implements", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/coperto-e-menu-fisso.md", "source_location": "L258", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_coperto_e_menu_fisso_order_charges", "target": "docs_coperto_e_menu_fisso_cover_charge", "relation": "implements", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/coperto-e-menu-fisso.md", "source_location": "L63", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_coperto_e_menu_fisso_order_cover_charge", "target": "docs_coperto_e_menu_fisso_cover_charge", "relation": "implements", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/coperto-e-menu-fisso.md", "source_location": "L188", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_coperto_e_menu_fisso_real_rows_rule", "target": "docs_coperto_e_menu_fisso_fixed_menu", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/coperto-e-menu-fisso.md", "source_location": "L26", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_coperto_e_menu_fisso", "target": "docs_palmare", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/coperto-e-menu-fisso.md", "source_location": "L224", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_coperto_e_menu_fisso", "target": "docs_order_flow_and_navigation", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/coperto-e-menu-fisso.md", "source_location": "L82", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_coperto_e_menu_fisso_covers_for_new_order", "target": "docs_table_management_reservations", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/coperto-e-menu-fisso.md", "source_location": "L89", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_coperto_e_menu_fisso_covers_for_new_order", "target": "docs_order_flow_and_naviga